OL,3,GYorkshire & Humber
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FEarly cloud and drizzle soon
OL,6,Fclearing, then dry and bright with
OL,7,Fsunny spells this morning. Cloud
OL,8,Fthickening and wind strengthening
OL,9,Flater in the afternoon with outbreaks
OL,10,Fof rain arriving in the northwest
OL,11,Ftowards evening.
OL,12,
OL,13,CTonight:FSoon becoming wet and windy
OL,14,Fthis evening with rain, occasionally
OL,15,Fheavy, moving southeastwards. Becoming
OL,16,Fdrier with clear spells during the
OL,17,Fearly hours, but remaining breezy.
OL,18,
OL,19,CTuesday:FA mixture of sunny spells and
OL,20,Fshowers on Tuesday, these perhaps
OL,21,Foccasionally heavy. Wind strengthening.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
